# Line endings. Text files are stored with LF; checkout follows core.autocrlf / core.eol, so a
# Windows working tree keeps CRLF exactly as before. Shell scripts and the pinned Lean project
# files (lean/) are LF on every OS: bash needs it, and the Lean files must stay byte-identical.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
lean/** text eol=lf
